# 01_cliff_entrance (the world 1baa96c2), the layer 3 holds the six commandoes and the four cover
# points; the same states are forced one after the other.
@f30 layer 3
@f120 objs commando
@f160 send u05df Activate
@f200 place u05df player 5
@f260 fsm u05df CoverFind
@f320 fsm u05df WallHang
@f420 fsm u05df WallDetach
@f480 fsm u05df JumpPointFind
@f520 fsm u05df Ambush
@f560 fsm u05df Dead
@f600 fsm u05df SetCoverDest
@f640 fsm u05df SetJumpDest
@f680 fsm u05df SetRetreatDest
@f720 fsm u05df BreakCover
@f760 fsm u05df Cover
@f800 fsm u05df ArmShield
@f840 fsm u05df Lurk
@f880 fsm u05df WarpOut
@f920 fsm u05df PostWarpOut
@f960 objs commando
